@bearer_token=HIER_TOKEN_EINTRAGEN
@project_id=1
@employee_id=1
@customer_id=1

### Bestehendes Projekt ändern
PUT http://localhost:8080/projects/{{project_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aktualisiertes Kundenportal",
  "responsibleEmployeeId": {{employee_id}},
  "customerId": {{customer_id}},
  "customerContactName": "Anna Müller",
  "comment": "Entwicklung eines neuen Kundenportals",
  "startDate": "2026-11-01",
  "endDate": "2026-12-15"
}
